  {
   "id": "brotherhood-united-103493@2.0",
   "gameId": "brotherhood-united-103493",
   "displayName": "Update 2.0",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2019-02-15T18:08:41.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi Myoubouh! [/ b]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Version 2.0 of Brotherhood United is finally available !",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32889631/dd0d083678e83639111ce9dda448a95be153558a.png [/ img]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This version brings a big plus compared to the previous version. You can now play in cooperation with a friend in local ! Just update the game if you already own it, the update is completely free !",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The cooperation mode is slightly different from the solo mode. There are roughly more enemies to block your road and Bosses are a little more resistant.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32889631/3bc3d792606aebd836709a6c0975d2c16553ce11.jpg [/ img]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Proposing this update to you has not been an easy task and it asked about 8 months of work, but we are really happy to have managed to do everything possible to offer players what they expect in our view. more than an old-fashioned Run And Gun.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
