  },
  {
   "id": "brotherhood-united-103493@1.1",
   "gameId": "brotherhood-united-103493",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2018-06-20T20:24:26.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Some of you may have experienced some problems to got all the 3 Stars on two or three levels. We took time to correct that, and we improved in the same time the ennemi and bro counter.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now each area has it's own ennemi and bro to rescue counter. That allows the player to know better what is exactly missing to complete one area.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also added a \"missed\" counter for the ennemies and bro's that you forget in the level. When you get a miss somewhere it means that in the previous areas you forgot to save your friends or that you left some enemies alive.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We really hope that these improvements will help you to complete Brotherhood United at 100%. And we deeply apologize for the inconvenience that this bug may have caused to some people.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Have fun and if you have some questions don't hesitate ! ;)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
